solution:
**Given:**

 tan theta = (4)/(3) 

**Formula Used:**

 cos²theta - sin²theta = frac{1 - tan²theta}{1 + tan²theta} 

**Calculation:**

⇒ tan²theta = ((4)/(3))² = (16)/(9) 

⇒ frac{1 - tan²theta}{1 + tan²theta} = (1 - frac{16)/(9)}{1 + (16)/(9)} 

⇒ = (frac{9 - 16)/(9)}{(9 + 16)/(9)} 

⇒ = (-7)/(25) 

**∴ The correct answer is -(7)/(25) .**
